e floor plan","id":"Denah ruang keluarga lantai basement"}},"03.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"地下层会客厅平面图（含家具布置）","en":"Basement lounge floor plan (with furniture layout)","id":"Denah ruang keluarga lantai basement (dengan tata letak furnitur)"}},"04.jpg":{"room":"living","desc":{"zh":"挑空会客厅全景，悬浮楼梯与艺术吊灯","en":"Panorama of the double-height living room, floating staircase and sculptural chandelier","id":"Panorama ruang keluarga double-height, tangga melayang, dan chandelier artistik"}},"05.jpg":{"room":"staircase","desc":{"zh":"悬浮楼梯挑空区，俯瞰娱乐区","en":"Floating staircase void overlooking the recreation area","id":"Area void tangga melayang yang menghadap area rekreasi"}},"06.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"会客厅平面图","en":"Living room floor plan","id":"Denah ruang keluarga"}},"07.jpg":{"room":"living","desc":{"zh":"会客厅会客区，围合式沙发与天井采光","en":"Conversation area with enclosed sofa arrangement and courtyard skylight","id":"Area duduk dengan sofa melingkar dan cahaya alami dari inner court"}},"08.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"会客厅平面图","en":"Living room floor plan","id":"Denah ruang keluarga"}},"09.jpg":{"room":"recreation","desc":{"zh":"台球娱乐区，深色背景墙与造型吊灯","en":"Billiards recreation area with dark accent wall and statement pendant","id":"Area rekreasi biliar dengan dinding aksen gelap dan lampu gantung dekoratif"}},"10.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"落尘区与卫生间平面图","en":"Entry foyer and bathroom floor plan","id":"Denah area foyer dan kamar mandi"}},"11.jpg":{"room":"tea_room","desc":{"zh":"茗茶焚香区，中式屏风与盆景陈设","en":"Tea and incense area with Chinese screen and bonsai arrangement","id":"Area teh dan dupa dengan sketsel Tiongkok dan penataan bonsai"}},"12.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"茗茶焚香区平面图","en":"Tea area floor plan","id":"Denah area teh"}},"13.jpg":{"room":"bar","desc":{"zh":"水吧区，整面储物柜与悬挑吧台","en":"Bar area with full-wall storage and cantilevered counter","id":"Area bar dengan lemari penyimpanan sepanjang dinding dan meja bar kantilever"}},"14.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"茗茶焚香区平面图","en":"Tea area floor plan","id":"Denah area teh"}},"15.jpg":{"room":"study","desc":{"zh":"学习区，长桌与整墙书架","en":"Study area with long table and full-wall bookshelves","id":"Ruang belajar dengan meja panjang dan rak buku sepanjang dinding"}},"16.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"学习区平面图","en":"Study area floor plan","id":"Denah ruang belajar"}},"17.jpg":{"room":"study","desc":{"zh":"学习区与楼梯间，悬浮踏步","en":"Study area and staircase with floating treads","id":"Ruang belajar dan tangga dengan anak tangga melayang"}},"18.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"卫生间与学习区平面图","en":"Bathroom and study area floor plan","id":"Denah kamar mandi dan ruang belajar"}},"19.jpg":{"room":"living","desc":{"zh":"客餐厅一体空间，电视墙与钢琴区","en":"Open-plan living and dining space with TV wall and piano corner","id":"Ruang keluarga-makan terbuka dengan dinding TV dan sudut piano"}},"20.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"一层餐厅与主卧平面图","en":"First-floor dining room and master bedroom plan","id":"Denah ruang makan dan kamar utama lantai satu"}},"21.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"一层平面图","en":"First-floor plan","id":"Denah lantai satu"}},"22.jpg":{"room":"bedroom","desc":{"zh":"主卧连通阳台，落地窗引入庭院景观","en":"Master bedroom connected to balcony, floor-to-ceiling windows framing courtyard views","id":"Kamar utama terhubung ke balkon, jendela floor-to-ceiling menghadirkan pemandangan taman"}},"23.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"一层平面图","en":"First-floor plan","id":"Denah lantai satu"}},"24.jpg":{"room":"living","desc":{"zh":"客厅电视墙，深色背景与壁炉造型","en":"Living room TV wall with dark backdrop and fireplace feature","id":"Dinding TV ruang keluarga dengan latar gelap dan aksen perapian"}},"25.jpg":{"room":"plan","desc":{"zh":"一层平面图","en":"First-floor plan","id":"Denah lantai satu"}},"26.jpg":{"room":"bedroom","desc":{"zh":"主卧起居视角，床尾电视墙与衣帽间入口","en":"Master bedroom view: TV wall at the foot of the bed and walk-in closet entrance","id":"Sudut kamar utama: dinding TV di ujung tempat tidur dan pintu walk-in closet"}},"27.jpg":{"